<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-zizhitongjian" book-id="b-zizhitongjian-177" chapter-id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong" source-id="s-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong-ws1960991">
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0000" ref="goh_vpj_95z_A">高熲</persName>先入建康，熲子<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0009" ref="goh_vpj_95z_AA">德弘</persName>為<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0012" ref="ce8_yhf_283_AAAAAAA">晉王廣</persName>記室，廣使<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0020" ref="goh_vpj_95z_AA">德弘</persName>馳詣熲所，令留<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0029" ref="3jv_fyp_o96">張麗華</persName>，熲曰：「昔<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0038" ref="1g3_02y_oor">太公</persName>蒙面以斬<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0044" ref="42a_nv5_urq">妲己</persName>，今豈可留麗華！」乃斬之於青溪。<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-177-zhanglihua-gaojiong:p001:m0062" ref="goh_vpj_95z_AA">德弘</persName>還報，廣變色曰：「昔人云，『無德不報』，我必有以報高公矣！」由是恨熲。</p>
</text>
